{"type": "question", "run_id": "20261102-005901-questions", "trace_id": "5c3a1790bc95e73c9173d27744ed13b5", "idx": 5, "q": "考績拿 A 的話年終大概幾個月？", "before": [], "expect_file": "考績管理辦法.docx", "kind": "answer", "start_ns": 1793552363682041200, "ok": false, "why": "看過全文=True 引用正確=True 內容正確=False（被要求驗算）", "answer": "考績拿 A 的話，年終獎金為 180,000 元（假設月薪為 120,000 元）[[考績管理辦法.docx]]。\n\n**細節說明：**\n- 年終獎金計算方式為：以一點五個月薪資為基準，A 等乘以一點五倍。\n- 例如，若月薪為 120,000 元，則年終獎金為 120,000 × 1.5 = 180,000 元。\n\n**申請方式：**\n- 考績結果會於每年考核後公布，並由部門主管核定。\n- 年終獎金會於次年發放，通常與年終獎金一同發放。\n\n📄 參考文件：[[考績管理辦法.docx]]", "fixes": [], "nudged": false, "calc_nudged": true, "end_ns": 1793552374577459300, "total_ms": 10895.4, "spans": [{"span_id": "f2063642023bcb57", "parent_id": null, "name": "ask", "kind": "turn", "start_ns": 1793552363682041200, "attrs": {"question": "考績拿 A 的話年終大概幾個月？"}, "end_ns": 1793552374577459300, "duration_ms": 10895.4}, {"span_id": "fe11878acd6f4082", "parent_id": "f2063642023bcb57", "name": "mcp.list_tools", "kind": "tool", "start_ns": 1793552363682041200, "attrs": {}, "end_ns": 1793552363713085200, "duration_ms": 31.0}, {"span_id": "aeca895c12acfb05", "parent_id": "f2063642023bcb57", "name": "llm.chat", "kind": "llm", "start_ns": 1793552364108223600, "attrs": {"model": "qwen3:8b", "think": false, "step": 0, "n_messages": 2, "response_model": "qwen3:8b", "input_tokens": 1272, "output_tokens": 32, "ollama_total_ms": 689.0, "ollama_load_ms": 8.8, "tool_calls": ["search_related_policies"], "content_chars": 0, "thinking_chars": 0}, "end_ns": 1793552364810163500, "duration_ms": 701.9}, {"span_id": "4b103850ba08f544", "parent_id": "f2063642023bcb57", "name": "tool.search_related_policies", "kind": "tool", "start_ns": 1793552364810163500, "attrs": {"tool": "search_related_policies", "args": {"query": "考績拿 A 的話年終大概幾個月"}, "by": "model", "result_chars": 1159, "result_preview": "搜尋「考績拿 A 的話年終大概幾個月」的結果（只回答使用者這次問的問題，不要整理其他文件）：\n\n1. [[考績管理辦法.docx]]（相關度 0.626，命中 2 段）\n《全文》[[考績管理辦法.docx]]\n考績管理辦法\n星芽科技股份有限公司（虛構公司，示範用）\